{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640000/extras/Holden_Final.gif?t=1749486928\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Don\u2019t Panic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sunrise. Twilight of earth. The world is ending. Acrid auromas of sun-scorched streets fill the air. Blackened corpses gnarled into shapes of agony line streets. Peering outside is enough to scorch eyes from socket. The only refuge is in the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But the night belongs to the Visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640000/extras/gif_1.gif?t=1749486928\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Let the Right Ones In</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A knock on the door. A solitary voice, begging for refuge. They look like us. Talk like us. Smell like us. Are they us? Look for the signs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640000/extras/gif2.gif?t=1749486928\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your Guests, Your Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Isolation is not an option. The Visitors will overwhelm us. Let some in. Hear their stories. Some will help. Some will need help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some are Visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640000/extras/gif_3.gif?t=1749486928\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Do What You Must</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Visitors kill. Kill them first. Interrogate the guests. Do what must be done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640000/extras/gif_4.gif?t=1749486928\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Over the Garden Wall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steams